-- Later notes
Currently:

drag_selected_system // directly mutates transforms

Proposed:

    Instead of mutating transforms directly, emit a GateMovedEvent { entity, new_position: Vec2 }.

    Then a separate system applies the transform update and spatial grid update.

💡 Why:

    Makes movement testable.

    Allows undo, snapping, constraints, or other systems to hook into gate movement.


draw_connections_system // runs on startup
update_connections_system // always runs

Proposed:

    Fire ConnectionCreatedEvent when a connection is added to the Simulation.

    Fire ConnectionUpdatedEvent when gates move.

💡 Why:

    Reactively spawn or update lines only when needed.

    Reduce computation per frame (don't always reprocess everything).